        "created_at": "2013-03-13T22:03:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When you guys have finished with the Herculean task of sending out all of the remaining shipments, please could you let me know if it will be possible to replace these Omnitron-X cards that have a big scratch across them? I don't mind paying for them as it's only five cards.</p><p>This seemed a better place to ask than the email which often seems to have suffered a time catalcysm!</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5d31c78de05a08a75190360af9e19b295d6fc724.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/5d31c78de05a08a75190360af9e19b295d6fc724\" title=\"Image.jpg\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5d31c78de05a08a75190360af9e19b295d6fc724_2_307x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Image.jpg\" data-base62-sha1=\"dir3wyDrcA0PLsY4kDtr29AOcuw\" width=\"307\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5d31c78de05a08a75190360af9e19b295d6fc724_2_307x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5d31c78de05a08a75190360af9e19b295d6fc724_2_460x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5d31c78de05a08a75190360af9e19b295d6fc724_2_614x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5d31c78de05a08a75190360af9e19b295d6fc724_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Image.jpg</span><span class=\"informations\">744×1208 412 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
